      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCK NIEN (3) was out of the money two back at this track. Turned in a better run last time out when second over 1780m here, beaten 5 metres. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Won't find this any harder and he can give this a mighty shake. BIZZIE LIZZIE (7) finished fourth last start over 1660m at Albion Park, beaten 8 metres, after a good win at this circuit the run prior. Can settle just behind them and wait on the sprint lane. Leading hope if she is at her best. WESTERN BILL (1) is the next elect off a last-start win by a neck at this venue over 1780m. Include from the coveted pegs draw. A PERFECT DANCE (6) must be considered after she finished runner-up over 1780m at this course a week ago. One for the multiples.",
